Conffiles:
 /etc/apparmor.d/palos-fen adc975f78f9cb2197945daf01be54242
Description: Fen: palOS's viewer for photos, PDFs and fonts
 Photos: every common format plus HEIC/HEIF, TIFF and camera RAW; zoom, pan,
 rotate and flip (lossless for JPEG), crop, resize, export to JPEG, PNG or
 WebP, copy, print, set as desktop picture, slideshow, a filmstrip of the
 rest of the folder, and camera details (lens, exposure, location).
 .
 PDFs: continuous pages with selectable text and working links, page
 thumbnails, table of contents, find, zoom, rotate, two-page spreads,
 password-protected files, fillable forms saved back into the PDF, print
 and a full-screen presentation mode. Pages are drawn with pdf.js (Mozilla).
 .
 Fonts: a type specimen at every size, the character set, and Install.
 Runs on Seeker's Electron runtime.
